   615	### Coordinator rulings (binding)
   616	- **The telling (day 100).** Oryn named what was done to her in her own terms and set the condition — **self first, ask first, tell her** — as HERS. Cael did not argue his reasons; nothing on the page forgives him for confessing; no consent was supplied after the fact; the acquisition stands. Her answer to what she would have said at the door is withheld, from the reader too. She was told the mechanism as a RETELLING of what the five established in Book 6 (his own Arbiter woke at Kindling; the plate lit eleven seconds late; the failed-safe word; the Arbiter went dark), sources by Path and not by person except the three she has touched. **Seln is not identified to her as the source of Shadow-adjacent.**
   617	- **The debt:** three readings of himself, on three different days, then all of it to her at once, nobody on the road. OWED; the day is hers to set; NOT paid in this movement. The tenth has been used on nobody but himself.
   618	- **Integration cost paid** as the listening cascade (it listens, it doesn't pull): his own current at the edge of thought; the nine heard one at a time; the tenth is "the thing I'm hearing with"; Storm heard resettling. Loudest is "nearer", under the breastbone.
   619	- **Deployment since the Line: THIRTEEN, unchanged.** Eleven small Wind leans in yard practice on day 101 are logged as practice, outside the count.
   620	- **The birthday, day 102: nineteen.** Six places. Cash 102 after it. Hesk's note with the straightedge is on the page. Never beside a season, a month order or a count back.
   621	- **Named in this movement: *the Quieting*** (Karis, "because it is the right grammar": a process, not a place). **[UNBOUND] said once, aloud, as a limit.** Karis's hypothesis is NOT stated anywhere. The three standing words ("Still open. Still real. Patience.") are retired, with the reason. **"The still place" is not said in this movement**; it remains Cael's private log label from Books 5–6 and becomes a located, spoken finding in Movement 8.
   622	- **Karis's five findings** stand as scenes; she does not know the strokes are letters, counts kinds and will not number them from one site; the bands were rubbed a hand above the floor; identical failure across five sigils (Iron R1, Copper, Iron R3, Bronze, Iron R4). Karis is Ember, Iron Rank Three.
   623	- **Pike's Fallow copy** came by carter ("Six went in. Six came out."), set against Cael's MEMORY of Gault's line; no leaf of Gault's is carried. Hesk's package did not come with it.
   624	- **Oryn:** stayed five extra days for one slow mark on Lira's arm; "sixteen out of this gate"; left by the northern wicket at first light on the 111th in the protected words ("North in the morning… three days north by the time you're back at the board… Thornwater's on my route"). Her mule is with the crew (#24). She will be at Millrace on the 113th (EXC-B7-003, owner-resolved: her circuit brings her round).
