     1	# Chapter 50 — The Square of Grey
     2	
     3	They had the day in that room by the colour of one small square.
     4	
     5	It stood at the head of forty steps, a man's height on each side, and for the first hours after the lamp went out it was grey, and everything else was black. Cael learned the room by its sounds, and he went over it again and again, since it steadied him to know where each of them was.
