   140	
   141	"I've another side," said Brom.
   142	
   143	"I've seen it. Be quiet." She turned on her knees. "You. Give me that arm, and give me the lamp to somebody else."
   144	
   145	Lira gave the lamp to Karis. She held out the sling without a word, and the healer undid her own knot, and unwound a strip of Cael's shirt that had gone stiff and dark, and put her two hands round the forearm.
   146	
